      },
      "message": "feat(xtask): plan one release heavy step for each test binary\n\nThe release tier ran each heavy lane as one cargo step. It now builds\nmotion and app once in release (--no-run), then plans one step for the\nlib, bins, doc tests and each integration binary that can hold an\nignored test. The log note names failed tests and tests libtest reports\nas running over 60 s. The set of tests the lanes run is unchanged.\n\nFixes #1714\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
